      ],
      "source": "https://treasureidaho.com/city/horseshoe-bend/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "An 1989 dig near Bread Rock uncovered evidence of human activity in the area dating back at least 3,000 years.",
